  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables.png\" alt=\"small_logo\" width=\"12.5%\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin-right:1rem\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables_banner.png\" width=\"60%\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin-right:1rem\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08/searchables/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/jaredlll08/searchables?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Github Issues\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08/searchables/blob/1.19.4/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/jaredlll08/searchables?color=3da6e4&style=flat-square\" alt=\"License \" width=\"78\" height=\"20\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Searchables 是一个库模组，它添加了辅助方法，允许基于组件（如 </span>shape:square color:red<span style=\"font-size=\"14px\">）搜索和过滤元素，并提供内置的自动完成功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>自动完成功能的效果如下：</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables_autocomplete.gif\" alt=\"searchables autocomplete\" width=\"813\" height=\"406\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组本身没有任何功能，而是被其他模组用于提升搜索体验。</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fjared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/Nodecraft-logo-on-white.png\" alt=\"\"></a>  \n本项目由 Nodecraft 赞助。使用代码 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fjared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JARED</a> 可在首月服务中获得 30% 折扣！</strong></p>",
